      "content": "hey so im taking ambien (zolpidem) for sleep cuz im having a really rough week with stress... but i also really like having like one glass of red wine before bed to help me relax. is it totally fine to have that glass of wine on the same night i take my pill? i just want to make sure i sleep well tonight",
